## **3️⃣ List All Registered Farmers**
```c
// Function to list all registered farmers
void listFarmers() {
    printf("\n======= Registered Farmers =======\n");
    for (int i = 0; i < TABLE_SIZE; i++) {
        Farmer* temp = farmerTable[i];
        while (temp != NULL) {
            printf("ID: %d | Name: %s\n", temp->farmerID, temp->name);
            temp = temp->next;
        }
    }
    printf("==================================\n");
}
```
**🔹 What This Does:**  
1. **Loops through the hash table** to list all farmers.  
2. **Displays their ID and Name** (but not the PIN for security).  

